    {
      "id": 488615,
      "username": "Omar-Abdullah",
      "name": "Omar Shaikh Al Zoor",
      "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:41:03.883Z",
      "cooked": "<p>These are functions, do not enclose them in quotes (““):</p>\n<p><strong>Wrong</strong>: “default”: “frappe.datetime.add_months(frappe.datetime.get_today(), -3)”<br>\n<strong>Correct</strong>: “default”: frappe.datetime.add_months(frappe.datetime.get_today(), -3)</p>",
